@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Maintenance jobs — separate, explicit processes
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam ArrowColor #475569

package "embeddingjob" {
  component "EmbeddingIndexApplication\nCatalogueEmbeddingJob\nAudiobookEmbeddingIndexer" as Embedding #DCFCE7
}
package "shortdescriptionjob" {
  component "ShortDescriptionApplication\nShortDescriptionEnricher" as Summary #DCFCE7
}
package "migrationjob" {
  component "MigrationApplication\nSolrToQdrantMigrator" as Migration #DBEAFE
}
package "userpreferencejob" {
  component "UserPreferenceApplication\nStreamingUserPreferenceImporter\nExternal sort + whole-user aggregation" as Preferences #DBEAFE
}
package "snapshotjob" {
  component "BookVectorSnapshotApplication\nSnapshotConfiguration + SnapshotSources" as Snapshot #DBEAFE
}
component "catalogue\nAudiobook ports, adapters,\nmodels and vector utilities" as Shared #FEF3C7
database "Selected catalogue\nSolr OR Qdrant" as Catalogue
database "Solr source" as SolrSource
database "Qdrant destination" as QdrantTarget
database "Selected user-preference collection\nSolr OR Qdrant" as UserStore
artifact "Persistent binary snapshot\nBookVectorSnapshot\nLast compatible version; checksummed" as LocalSnapshot
artifact "Favourites + history CSVs" as CSV
cloud "Embedding model" as EmbeddingModel
cloud "Regular summary API" as SummaryModel

Embedding ..> Shared : reuses
Summary ..> Shared : reuses
Migration ..> Shared : reuses
Preferences ..> Shared : reuses
Snapshot ..> Shared : reuses

Embedding --> Catalogue : read books / fill missing or rebuild vectors
Embedding --> EmbeddingModel : book text → embedding
Embedding --> LocalSnapshot : export existing vectors after success\nusing shared snapshot publisher
Snapshot --> Catalogue : read existing IDs and dense vectors
Snapshot --> LocalSnapshot : validate then atomically publish
Summary --> Catalogue : read descriptions / fill missing or rebuild summaries
Summary --> SummaryModel : generate missing summaries (regular API)
Migration --> SolrSource : read existing fields and vectors
Migration --> QdrantTarget : create/fill books matched by payload id
CSV --> Preferences : user interactions
Preferences --> LocalSnapshot : validate and load once\nno remote catalogue-vector lookup
Preferences --> UserStore : explicit write: save or clear taste vectors\ndry-run: validating sink, no writes

note bottom of Shared
  Embedding and snapshot launchers share one publisher.
  Daily user import consumes the last compatible snapshot.
  All jobs use shared.jobruntime.JobProgress for periodic reporting.
  recommenderagent does not depend on the jobs.
  Catalogue code has no dependency on recommenderagent.
  User-preference storage remains in recommenderagent.storage.user.
end note
legend bottom
  Migration copies existing data; it generates no embeddings or summaries.
  Five non-web launchers; snapshot launcher needs no enable flag.
  Jobs never run during ordinary recommendation-server startup.
  Run maintenance writers separately against a stable catalogue.
endlegend
@enduml
